{"t": 1793283076481, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "objective_clip", "Objective 7 'Reach the Village era' progress bar text is clipped on the left: shows 'bers 6/10 • Buildings 0/2' instead of 'Members 6/10 • Buildings 0/2' (Objective panel too narrow). Also K inside the settlement offers a House first; the Settlement Info 'Next (K)' changed from Farm to House between visits, so a player wanting a winter Farm must find the Build Farm button."]}
