{"t": 1793283091047, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "buttons_shift", "Settlement action bar reflows while you aim: when the market filled ('Build Stall' vanished) and a pawn walked up (Order/Talk/Gift rows added), 'Build Farm' moved from ~(625,445) to ~(476,445) and my click on it hit 'Send Caravan (Town era)' instead. Buttons jumping under the pointer at 2-3 fps causes misclicks."]}
