{"t": 1793283140424, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "confirm_timeout", "Build Farm's 'Click again to confirm' window expires in ~70 ticks (~1.4 game s, ~8 s wall at 9-15 tps / 2-3 fps). Three deliberate second clicks (ticks 127596, 127692, 127784) all got 'Not confirmed in time, so nothing was done.' Only two back-to-back clicks worked (Farm built at tick 127944). The confirm window is too short for a slow machine or a careful player."]}
{"t": 1793283140684, "cmd": "state", "args": []}
{"t": 1793283234006, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "winter_unreachable", "Goal 'survive the first winter' cannot be reached in a 35-min session: --season autumn starts at day 4 = 'Autumn - day 1/2, Winter in 2 days' (winter begins at tick 180000). At the observed 9-17 tps the remaining ~52k ticks take ~60+ wall minutes. A --season late-autumn / 'winter tomorrow' start (or starting on autumn's last day) would make winter testable."]}
{"t": 1793283234430, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "food_easy", "Food never mattered in autumn: by tick 128000 I held 26 apples from incidental tree chopping (each tree drops 1-3 apples), energy stayed 92-99 the whole time (it even rose from 84 to 98 early on without me eating), and the settlement shows 'Feed Residents (0 hungry)'. No sense of pressure to lay in food before winter beyond the orange 'Winter in 2 days' line."]}
